## Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Java at the `java.version` in the root `pom.xml`, or newer
- Maven, or the Maven wrapper (`./mvnw`) when the project has one
- Docker, for the integration tests<!-- IF compose --> and the development database<!-- END compose -->
<!-- IF frontend!=none -->
- Node.js and npm for frontend development<!-- IF frontend=embedded --> (the Maven build installs its own Node)<!-- END frontend -->
<!-- END frontend -->
<!-- IF compose=false -->
- A running {{db_label}}, configured in `backend/src/main/resources/application.yml`
<!-- END compose -->

### Run

```bash
<!-- IF frontend!=none -->
./dev.sh              # backend + frontend together
./dev.sh backend      # backend only on :8080
./dev.sh frontend     # vite dev server on :5173
./dev.sh generate     # regenerate the TypeScript client from the running backend's spec
<!-- END frontend -->
<!-- IF frontend=none -->
./dev.sh backend      # backend on :8080
<!-- END frontend -->
```

### Build

```bash
<!-- IF frontend!=none -->
(cd frontend && npm install)   # first time: creates package-lock.json (commit it)
<!-- END frontend -->
./mvnw package                 # the JAR<!-- IF frontend=embedded -->, with the SPA inside<!-- END frontend -->
<!-- IF frontend=embedded -->
./mvnw package -Pskip-frontend # backend only, no Node/npm
<!-- END frontend -->
```

### Test

```bash
<!-- IF frontend=embedded -->
./mvnw verify -Pskip-frontend  # unit + integration tests (Docker); regenerates contracts/openapi.json
<!-- END frontend -->
<!-- IF frontend!=embedded -->
./mvnw verify                  # unit + integration tests (Docker); regenerates contracts/openapi.json
<!-- END frontend -->
<!-- IF frontend!=none -->
(cd frontend && npm test -- --run)
<!-- END frontend -->
```

For a fast inner loop, see `CLAUDE.md` → "Inner-loop integration tests".
